  ✓ Stage 2: check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: reconstruct definitions and independently prove all positive claims
  ✓ Stage 4–5: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and every local rule
  ✓ Stage 6: build and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  → Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md
